{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42260","headline":"梦游三首 二 · 徐铉","name":"梦游三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绣幌银屏杳霭间，若非魂梦到应难。\n窗前人静偏宜夜，户内春浓不识寒。\n蘸甲遰觞纤似玉，含词忍笑腻於檀。\n锦书若要知名字，满县花开不姓潘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}